      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, the Ingest agent child process.\n\nThe key details are:\n\n- **When**: The key is injected immediately before the child process starts\n- **Where**: Into the environment variables of the spawned Ingest agent process (and similarly for the Query agent process)\n- **How it\u0027s loaded**: A local secrets loader reads it from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- **What\u0027s protected**: The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and never holds the key itself\n\nThis design ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment \u2014 the key exists only within the short-lived child process that actually needs to call the Anthropic API.",
